{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Battle Royale Manager</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-powered battle royale where your strategy determines who survives.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Battle Royale Manager</strong>, you don\u2019t control the fighters\u2014you build them. Train survivors, develop personalized strategies, place bold bets, and watch the chaos unfold in fully simulated <strong>AI-driven battle royale matches</strong>. You're not a fighter. You're the mastermind behind the fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train and Enhance</strong><br>Improve your survivors\u2019 stats through training, or go further with surgeries and modifications to give them an edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Behavior System</strong><br>Customize how each survivor behaves during the match. Set aggression levels, target priorities, movement preferences, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Betting System</strong><br>Place bets before matches begin. Predict the winner, earn rewards, and reinvest in your fighters\u2019 growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Driven Battle Simulation</strong><br>All matches play out autonomously, driven by a sophisticated AI system that reacts to terrain, stats, and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leagues and Rankings</strong><br>Climb the ladder by sending your best survivors into the league. Compete for prestige and rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Strategy + Simulation + Management = The Ultimate Battle Royale</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t need to pull the trigger\u2014your decisions already have.<br>Every victory is built before the battle begins: in the training room, in the strategy plan, and in your mind.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hundred-Thousa